2.4.0-2 doesn't work and one hppa where it does work. One of the alphas 
was running 2.3.8-2 happily before the upgrade, the other had been running 
exim4.

One is running debian's 2.6.18-4-alpha-generic kernel, the other is 
running a custom built vanilla 2.6.15.6 kernel. The first has all packages 
freshly upgraded to sid, the other wasn't upgraded since yesterday, except 
to test the new postfix.

I'm not sure if I should really be posting this as a followup to the bug 
in postfix. I'm guessing it's more likely to be a glibc bug, but I just 
found this while trying to get mail working, and haven't had time to debug 
yet.

